<title>POLAND: POLFA KUTNO AUGUST NET RISES TO PLN 1.6.</title>
<headline>POLFA KUTNO AUGUST NET RISES TO PLN 1.6.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> AUGUST		  1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.62 vs   0.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.53 vs   1.23</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.88 vs   1.56</p>
<p> Sales		   12.90 vs  11.28</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    12.26 vs   7.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	19.08 vs  10.98</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.27 vs  13.84</p>
<p> Sales		  111.64 vs  96.50</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Polfa Kutno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
